<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96644" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφᾰνηφορ-ία</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανᾱφ-</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wearing of a
			wreath</i>, esp. of victory, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				8.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκας ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				862
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανήγυριν . . συντελεῖν μετὰ -ίας καὶ
					θυσιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					56.40
				</span></i>
			 (Canopus, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.23
			</span></i> (Scepsis, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίαν ἄγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGiss.</u>
					27.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the right of wearing a crown</i>, which belonged to certain
			magistrates (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανηφόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς κοιναῖς ς</span>. Lex
				ap.<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰς . . ς. πεποιηκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					2771 i 4
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Aphrodisias</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				2814
			</span></i> (ibid.), al.</div>
